Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.23,0:00:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaubou Yaubou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.97,0:00:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,YUM! Nova Nova
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, Battle City finalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.45,0:01:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,With the completion of the opening duel,\Nthere will be a half-hour intermission.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.77,0:01:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,At the end of this intermission,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.35,0:01:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,all remaining finalists are\Ninstructed to report to the main
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.71,0:01:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,concourse for the selection of the\Nnext Battle City finals matchup.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.19,0:01:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to help Akura.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And land this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.43,0:01:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's find Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.85,0:01:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be in one of these rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.65,0:01:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, this is a restricted area.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.05,0:01:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mokuba, where is your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his room, but you\Ndon't want to disturb him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Kaiba. Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.53,0:01:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's preparing for a duel. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.93,0:01:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you,\NKaiba. Get out here. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.47,0:01:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If it isn't Wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.29,0:01:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you're lucky to even be in my tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.57,0:01:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and yet you insist on making a nuisance\Nof yourself over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.77,0:01:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.21,0:02:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is no time to pick a\Nfight, so just calm down, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.21,0:02:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you've got to help\Nus! Now what? Bakura's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.11,0:02:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to land now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.51,0:02:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs to see a doctor\Nright away, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're asking me to do the impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't make an unscheduled stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.27,0:02:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura needs help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.69,0:02:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been unconscious\Nsince losing his duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he gets any worse than he is\Nright now, you'll be responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.81,0:02:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Kaiba, this is really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.57,0:02:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.07,0:02:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you say no to that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.25,0:02:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't have left the\Nhospital in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Bakura's own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't someone's health more\Nimportant than your silly game?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.37,0:02:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to her, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.83,0:02:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this attitude, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.61,0:02:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Find a way to land this\Nblimp pronto or get
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.13,0:02:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,ready to say hi to the\Nbusiness end of my fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you we're not landing, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, Chewie. What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.85,0:03:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a medical team to Bakora's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Good call, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Corp's on-board\Nmedical staff has better
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,training than the doctors\Nat most hospitals do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakora's in good hands here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.23,0:03:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Mokuba's right\Nabout the doctors on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.61,0:03:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it was great how you\Nstood up to Kaiba, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt the exact same\Nway you did back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have never been so\Nmoved by a speech in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, it's like your words came\Nright out of the mouth of an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.13,0:03:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,do you think that Bakura's gonna be okay\Nin the hands of Kaiba's quacks or what,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuge?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we still have to find\NBakura's missing Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.61,0:03:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be that difficult\Nif we split up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.89,0:03:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you guys worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.51,0:03:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave the Millennium\NRing to me and Devlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You two should stay focused on the next\Nround of the finals It's okay, Tristan,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:03:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,really No,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.11,0:04:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let my\Nfriends get distracted
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,before the biggest duel\Nof their lives Plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.77,0:04:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll give me and Duke\Nsomething to do Perfect,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.37,0:04:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity and I will search upstairs
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.71,0:04:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it, you're coming\Nwith me, Devlin. But I was,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,uh Zip it, that Millennium\NRing's not gonna find itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,so you and I have to work together,\Ndude Come on, we got work to do
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.57,0:04:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to see them\Ngetting along, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.07,0:04:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope they have luck\Nfinding Bakura's Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.43,0:04:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see a thing up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stop complaining\Nand checking that corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing up here but hot air.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.39,0:04:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And all of it's coming from\Nyou, Tristan, so lay off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, lover boy, you've been a pain in\Nmy neck since the day we ran into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to chill out\Nand remember why we're here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.31,0:04:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean, tough guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.59,0:04:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to lay\Noff Serenity, Devlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.97,0:05:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the girl some space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.45,0:05:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what your problem is, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You are afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid that Serenity might\Nlike me instead of liking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.61,0:05:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault that the\Nladies can't resist Duke Devlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I could turn the charm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.89,0:05:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't push me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not even a duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just some wannabe cheerleader who's always\Nyelling from the sidelines, Go, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.89,0:05:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.95,0:05:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really kind of pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls dig men of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.67,0:05:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, well, you're\Nno man of action. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.33,0:05:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you action!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.03,0:05:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.21,0:05:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.35,0:05:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, Duke, don't look down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:05:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Duke! I gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got me here in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.65,0:06:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, I have a plan! No joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.91,0:06:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait for this one! Someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.91,0:06:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your plan? Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.49,0:06:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone out there, help! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, we better hope someone hears\Nus, because it's a long way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.99,0:06:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How's your grip?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now that you bring it up, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My hand's gone numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.51,0:06:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give in. Fight it! I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.63,0:06:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let go! Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.97,0:06:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My hand is slipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,what's going on up there someone's got me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,hey can you pull us off\Nthanks i owe you one
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,we're gonna be okay duke
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,that was not fun who are you you saved our
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.87,0:07:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,lives how can we repay\Nyou huh where'd he go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.77,0:07:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.68,0:07:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.59,0:07:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.51,0:07:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy in the white bathrobe\Nwho just saved both our hides.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.11,0:07:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy who...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.65,0:07:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go find the rest of the gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I won the first duel\Nof the Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.33,0:07:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my Egyptian god\Ncard slifer, the Sky Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.31,0:07:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I still need to be careful with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.17,0:07:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like it has real\Npowers beyond this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.39,0:07:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're shoddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.53,0:07:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and you've learned much since we\Nfirst met in Jewelist Kingdom, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.45,0:07:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're beginning to understand your\Nfate and its relation to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A fate that intertwines with that of the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.67,0:07:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,spirit who dwells within\Nyour Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.71,0:07:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I know a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Yami was an ancient pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:07:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.51,0:08:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And together you must save the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,From an ancient evil. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you here to explain how?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm still confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.77,0:08:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I am but the guardian of\Nthe seven millennium items.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here because I sensed a disturbance\Nin the mystic alignment once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All seven items are on board this vessel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.19,0:08:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as the three Egyptian God Cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.63,0:08:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,which means all of the objects capable of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,saving and destroying the\Nworld are right here. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.21,0:08:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Earth's safety\Nrests with you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Heed my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.05,0:08:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If the wrong individuals were\Nto gain control of any of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the Millennium Items or one\Nof the Egyptian God Cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.69,0:08:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the results could be catastrophic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.07,0:08:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It nearly happened once before when Pegasus\Ncreated dual monsters. It did? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.53,0:08:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it all began when Maximilian\NPegasus first arrived in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.23,0:08:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He was searching for a method\Nof reuniting with his lost love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.07,0:09:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,His quest brought him to me, and I\Npresented him with the Millennium Eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.39,0:09:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,for he was destined to possess it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon after, he discovered the origins\Nof the ancient Egyptian shadow games.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.79,0:09:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus became obsessed\Nwith these games and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.01,0:09:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,decided to dedicate his\Nlife to recreating them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.87,0:09:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He sought to resurrect the ancient\Nmystical powers he discovered,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.57,0:09:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but much to his surprise,\Nit almost destroyed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus didn't know his limits,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.15,0:09:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but he would come to discover he'd\Nunleashed a power far beyond his control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.95,0:09:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.61,0:09:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoddy, how did Duel Monsters start?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.11,0:09:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus grew more obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Determined to recreate the Shadow Games,\Nhe discovered the Egyptian God Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.89,0:09:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And that almost destroyed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.37,0:09:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It all began during one of his early\Nresearch trips to the ancient pyramids where
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.03,0:09:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus planned to locate\Nthe stones depicting
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.61,0:10:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the Egyptian God Monsters he'd read about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You call yourself an archaeologist?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.17,0:10:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Find me these Egyptian godstones,\Nyou fool, or you're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.63,0:10:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.51,0:10:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be here somewhere, and\NI won't rest until I find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,These three monsters are an\Nessential part of my game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.81,0:10:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximilian Pegasus? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.93,0:10:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.67,0:10:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.45,0:10:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are searching for the\Nthree Egyptian god monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.47,0:10:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll never find them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been sealed away in a pharaoh's\Ntomb that no mortal can penetrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.33,0:10:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go on. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.15,0:10:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I possess the power to uncover the\Nhidden secrets of these ancient beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximilian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.53,0:10:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I must see them, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.19,0:10:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to take me there immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.17,0:10:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guided Pegasus and his\Nteam of archaeologists to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.51,0:10:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,an underground chamber hidden\Nbeneath the desert sands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.51,0:10:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.61,0:11:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The secrets of the most powerful\Nshadow monsters are at my fingertips.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.09,0:11:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, our journey is not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Astonishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,An entire underground city!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.65,0:11:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you're getting\Nall of this on tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.53,0:11:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us proceed, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.37,0:11:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What you seek lies this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.69,0:11:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This seems simpler than\Nyou described, shoddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Little did Pegasus know that the pharaoh's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.69,0:11:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,tomb had been carefully\Nguarded for millennia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.25,0:11:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone else is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How will we get past these men?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.37,0:11:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of my Millennium\NKey will protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.39,0:11:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, if you gentlemen will follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't they stopping us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.69,0:11:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We're invisible, cloaked in\Nthe magic of my item. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.49,0:11:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And after traveling by foot for\Nhours, our journey was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.89,0:11:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop. We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The creatures you seek\Nlie inside this chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, after 5,000 years, the three\NEgyptian god monsters will awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.23,0:12:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can take as many\Nphotographs as you'd like,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.33,0:12:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but you mustn't remove\Nanything you find within.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This one moment will make\Nmy entire trip worthwhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus entered the dimly-lit chamber\Nfirst, and his team soon followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,As promised, I brought him to the ancient\Nresting place of the Egyptian god tablets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.41,0:12:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside, Pegasus found what he came for,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,never knowing he was about to unleash\Na devastating force like no other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.19,0:12:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Winged Dragon of Ra, Obelisk the\NTormenter, Sliver the Sky Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.29,0:13:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,hello my ancient friends it's\Na pleasure to meet you at
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,last i can unlock the secret\Npowers of the three egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.41,0:13:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,god monsters once i immortalize\Nthese beautiful creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,in print my duel monsters\Ncard game will be complete
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.15,0:13:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,triumphant pegasus returned to america\Nto design his cards based upon the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.29,0:13:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,images he found on the stones whether\Nhe could control their incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.21,0:13:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,power i did not yet know you see he\Nwas destined to awaken the egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,god monsters but at a great cost\Nas pegasus was about to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.03,0:13:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,so let's see if i understand you\Ncorrectly you say everyone involved
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.43,0:13:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,in my egyptian god card project\Nhas met with disaster um yes sir
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.31,0:13:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,These photographs are\Nlike none I've ever taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost as though\Nthe camera captured the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,very power of these monsters\Nthrough the carvings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.49,0:14:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.40,0:14:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.69,0:14:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, I can unlock the secret powers\Nof the three Egyptian god monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.65,0:14:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I immortalize these beautiful\Ncreatures in print, my dual monster will...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In all my years of research, I've never\Nseen hieroglyphs quite like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.05,0:14:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I don't decipher them,\NPegasus will be furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.15,0:14:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.73,0:14:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What on Earth is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Each one has disappeared, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.37,0:15:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And I mean completely gone\Nwithout a single trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.09,0:15:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only think of one solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.27,0:15:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You must stop production\Nof these monster cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.86,0:15:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The production of the three\NEgyptian God cards is integral
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.81,0:15:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to the game of Fuel Monsters\Nand to my entire corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let these\Nlittle incidents stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.71,0:15:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on the verge of making\Nhistory here, Croquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.85,0:15:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if the cards are cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it myself under the\Nprotection of my millennium eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.97,0:15:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my amazing creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.89,0:15:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I am honored to bring you back\Nto life after all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll spare no detail in your recreation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.35,0:15:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.43,0:15:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't seem to be\Nmysteriously disappearing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.15,0:15:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,at the hands of these three creatures now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,do I, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:15:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're almost complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.83,0:16:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But Pegasus would soon learn\Nthat fate had other plans for him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.71,0:16:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and for the three Egyptian god\Ncards he had begun to create.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,For by that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.79,0:16:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I had realized that he was not destined\Nto control their powerful magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.65,0:16:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.89,0:16:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,By attempting to recreate the\Nimages of the Egyptian god monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You've unleashed a\Ndangerous force far beyond
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,your comprehension and\Nput the world at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.61,0:16:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll accept the burden\Nof these cards as my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll contain their great powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.17,0:16:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must bring the legacy of\Nfuel monsters to a new millennium.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.85,0:17:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It is clear to me now that you were\Nnot meant to control these monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.69,0:17:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your only hope is to return\Nthem to their resting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.97,0:17:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, their darkness will\Nconsume you and the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.35,0:17:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I've angered the Egyptian god\Nmonsters, and I felt their rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.97,0:17:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Their powers are very real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.65,0:17:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadi's words were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must lock the cards\Naway or face destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.51,0:17:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Although Maximilian Pegasus\Nhad already completed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,the prototypes of the\Nthree Egyptian god cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.19,0:17:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,he immediately flew to Egypt to\Nseal them in the tomb alongside
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.83,0:17:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the original carvings and spare\Nthe world their absolute power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been awaiting your return\Nto the land of the pharaohs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.85,0:17:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Ishizu Ishtar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.05,0:18:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And with the help of Ishizu,\NPegasus sealed away the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.63,0:18:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Merrick tried to steal them? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he were to get his hands on all\Nthree, the results would be devastating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,To you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can assure you, Merrick will never\Nhold all three Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.69,0:18:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My pharaoh, it is an honor for me\Nto be in your presence once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.51,0:18:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have great confidence in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you will restore order to\Nthe world and put an end to this chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.19,0:18:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,just as you did 5,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My complete faith lies in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.81,0:18:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All remaining finalists must now\Nreport to the main concourse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.71,0:18:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoddy, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.95,0:18:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The next two duelists will\Nnow be chosen. It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.39,0:18:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go join the others. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.89,0:18:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The future of mankind is depending on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.95,0:19:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your two-minute warning. All\Nfinalists must be on deck in two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.13,0:19:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No joke,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.27,0:19:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,there was this freaky guy in a\Nwhite robe He saved our lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.89,0:19:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,just ask Duke Well, I didn't actually see\Nhim, but someone had to pull us up Nah,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,get off, you guys If you're trying\Nto distract me before my duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.01,0:19:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not gonna work Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,what if there really\Nwas some kind of ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.29,0:19:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, ghosts don't exist
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready for the next duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.11,0:19:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sneak up on me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.43,0:19:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save you, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there's still good within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.25,0:19:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizu, it's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.66,0:19:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,With so much at stake, I should\Nhave known you'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.03,0:19:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, evil once again walks the\Nearth, bringing madness in its wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.51,0:20:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I just never thought my own brother\Nwould be the medium for this evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.65,0:20:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Merrick, the world must\Nbe saved, but at what cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.95,0:20:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep Bakura's\NMillennium Ring for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.05,0:20:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll also maintain occasional\Ncontrol over Taya's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.25,0:20:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My key shields me from her sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.59,0:20:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.13,0:20:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The mystic disturbance that brought\Nme here is strongest in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel that the destinies of certain\NMillennium items are being manipulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And until harmony is restored,\Nthe world will be in grave peril.
